<title>MALAYSIA: United Malayan stock suspended -KLSE.</title>
<headline>United Malayan stock suspended -KLSE.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of United Malayan Land Bhd were suspended pending a news announcement, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The stock was last traded in the morning at 6.00 ringgit, up five cents.  </p>
<p>The investment holding and property firm was reported in local newspapers on Tuesday as saying it expects to announce a land acquisition deal on Thursday.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman confirmed that agreements on a land purchase within a new high-technology corridor will be signed on Thursday.</p>
</text>
